      <h3>TL;DR</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloud-Managed WireGuard:</strong> MeshWG uses a cloud control plane to automate key exchange, peer discovery, and NAT traversal — turning WireGuard from a manual protocol into a managed service.</li>
        <li><strong>Peer-to-Peer by Default:</strong> Traffic between your cloud servers and branch offices flows directly, encrypted peer-to-peer. The MeshWG control plane coordinates connections but does not carry your data.</li>
